{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09811","headline":"临洮泛舟赵仙舟自北庭罢使还京 · 岑参","name":"临洮泛舟赵仙舟自北庭罢使还京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白发轮台使，边功竟不成。\n云沙万里地，孤负一书生。\n池上风回舫，桥西雨过城。\n醉眠乡梦罢，东望羡归程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}